  "composition_summary": "Preserved the volatile tail unchanged (single user request, no justified repair). Drafted one pure-logic class-22 component pc-transfer-08: it classifies a raw quota value into missing/null/integer/invalid using only inputs.get() presence checks and exact type/bound tests, returning the requested result object on every path with no imports, I/O, host calls, booleans-as-integers, coercion, defaults, or exceptions. The body assigns result directly at module scope. This is an unapproved draft; typed inputs require runner support, and no observed tests, submission, or activation occurred.",
